.TH TELEMAQUE 1 "November 2026" "Télémaque 1.0.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
telemaque \- simple BitTorrent client for GNOME (Télémaque)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B telemaque
[\fIOPTION\fR] [\fIFILE.torrent\fR | \fIMAGNET-LINK\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Télémaque downloads torrents with libtorrent: .torrent files and magnet links,
choice of the files to keep, pause, resume, sharing until a chosen ratio,
speed limits. Each file or magnet link given on the command line opens the
"Add a Torrent" dialog. If Télémaque is already running (in a window or in the
background), they are sent to the running instance.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/telemaque/settings.json
Preferences.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/telemaque/torrents/
Downloads in the list, resumed at the next start.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/ToFpon/Telemaque
